  "description": "Huffleheim Font is a modern classic serif typeface featuring elegant proportions and high-contrast construction. Built for editorial sophistication and premium branding, this serif font balances timeless beauty with contemporary precision.\nThe included Regular and Italic styles provide flexibility for luxury branding, magazines, architecture studios, and cinematic design projects.\nHuffleheim delivers structured elegance for print and digital applications.\nPerfect For\nLogo design, editorial layout, book covers, architecture branding, fashion campaigns, packaging design.",
